        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938850/extras/be75d59cc9f5403d6f3ee2e0b9c3cbbf.poster.avif?t=1765511968\" aria-label=\"An image depicting a brown haired foxgirl getting headpats, mouse cursor circles her head as hearts emerge. her tail wags relaxed, she rests her head on the raised knee of her mother, who is lying in bed under a tattered duvet.\" width=600 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938850/extras/be75d59cc9f5403d6f3ee2e0b9c3cbbf.webm?t=1765511968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938850/extras/be75d59cc9f5403d6f3ee2e0b9c3cbbf.mp4?t=1765511968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the Cradle is an Incremental RPG about Hina, a foxgirl trying to clear out the dungeon she was born in so she can leave with her mother and explore the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cradle is a mysterious place that doesn't allow anyone inside it to perish. <br>Instead, Hina is safely delivered back into the arms of her mother at the bottom of the dungeon whenever she would expire. <br> <br>Headpat Hina to restore her to full health, <br>Purchase Upgrades so she can come back stronger, <br>and Send her on her merry way again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows who or what made The Cradle...<br>No one knows what it's for...<br>Some say it's a training facility.<br>Some say a god made it to protect their child from the world.<br>Only one thing is certain...<br>The Cradle... <br>Doesn't want you to leave...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Headpat filled heartwarming story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute pixel art and juicy gamefeel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Live2d animated Foxgirl to headpat to your hearts content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Enemy riddled dungeon floors to conquer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill trees! Exchange Crystals for new skills and stat ups!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige system - reset your progress to turn levels into shards for even greater strength!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One happy ending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completion time roughly 3-4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938850/extras/be75d59cc9f5403d6f3ee2e0b9c3cbbf.poster.avif?t=1765511968\" aria-label=\"An image depicting a brown haired foxgirl getting headpats, mouse cursor circles her head as hearts emerge. her tail wags relaxed, she rests her head on the raised knee of her mother, who is lying in bed under a tattered duvet.\" width=600 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938850/extras/be75d59cc9f5403d6f3ee2e0b9c3cbbf.webm?t=1765511968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938850/extras/be75d59cc9f5403d6f3ee2e0b9c3cbbf.mp4?t=1765511968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the Cradle is an Incremental RPG about Hina, a foxgirl trying to clear out the dungeon she was born in so she can leave with her mother and explore the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cradle is a mysterious place that doesn't allow anyone inside it to perish. <br>Instead, Hina is safely delivered back into the arms of her mother at the bottom of the dungeon whenever she would expire. <br> <br>Headpat Hina to restore her to full health, <br>Purchase Upgrades so she can come back stronger, <br>and Send her on her merry way again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows who or what made The Cradle...<br>No one knows what it's for...<br>Some say it's a training facility.<br>Some say a god made it to protect their child from the world.<br>Only one thing is certain...<br>The Cradle... <br>Doesn't want you to leave...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Headpat filled heartwarming story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute pixel art and juicy gamefeel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Live2d animated Foxgirl to headpat to your hearts content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Enemy riddled dungeon floors to conquer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill trees! Exchange Crystals for new skills and stat ups!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige system - reset your progress to turn levels into shards for even greater strength!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One happy ending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completion time roughly 3-4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Escape the Cradle is an Incremental RPG with cute pixel art about a foxgirl trying to clear out the dungeon she was born in so she can leave with her mother and explore the outside world. She's animated with Live2d and you restore her hp between runs with headpats!",
